{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565510/extras/ekron-town-shipwheel-1.gif?t=1742759888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you will explore the beginning of your journey that is to be found in the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin by waking up on an island in the middle of a storm and find your way to shelter. Once inside use your wits and clues available to make it into the town. Once you are in the town you will uncover a handful of puzzles and the some of the story will be revealed to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version has English and Russian text, user interface, and voice overs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All screenshots and videos are content from the demo you will get to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565510?t=1742759888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565510/7a7a3aa1cd27b7186f1bfedc6b8caf29e14a18b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742759888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565510/a8384a549fc8e301cfa495933cc99712fe0b47e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742759888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565510/a8384a549fc8e301cfa495933cc99712fe0b47e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742759888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565510/extras/ekron-town-shipwheel-1.gif?t=1742759888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you will explore the beginning of your journey that is to be found in the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin by waking up on an island in the middle of a storm and find your way to shelter. Once inside use your wits and clues available to make it into the town. Once you are in the town you will uncover a handful of puzzles and the some of the story will be revealed to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version has English and Russian text, user interface, and voice overs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All screenshots and videos are content from the demo you will get to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["True Vine Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3252290","name":"Ekron"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565510/932966babe6b5c9696b04e7f274bc845e5590b4d/header.jpg?t=1742759888","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115626,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115626/movie480.mp4?t=1742494618","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115626/movie_max.mp4?t=1742494618"},"name":"Ekron Demo Main Trailer (ENG)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115626/ae387112afa69aa96cbd8519e34a8bffcdb2cfc6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742494618","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115626/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742494618","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115626/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742494618"}}],"name":"Ekron Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</s